    Faster R-CNN

    \;

    <image|image/faster_r_cnn.png|1par|||>

    <with|font-base-size|8|https://www.mathworks.com/help/vision/ug/getting-started-with-r-cnn-fast-r-cnn-and-faster-r-cnn.html>
  </hidden>|<\hidden>
    R-FCN

    <space|5em><image|image/r_fcn.png|.7par|||>

    <with|font-base-size|8|https://papers.readthedocs.io/en/latest/imagedetection/rfcn/>
